{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This single-player Japanese Mahjong game offers flexible battle modes, allowing you to freely choose between intense 2-player showdowns, strategic 3-player matches, or lively 4-player games. The game strictly uses a standard 136-tile deck, including numerical tiles (Man, Pin, Sou), and honor tiles (East, South, West, North, Red Dragon, Green Dragon, White Dragon).<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/95035dd18311b71bccbc24e045665987.avif?t=1762921433\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras_big/95035dd18311b71bccbc24e045665987.avif?t=1762921433 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Staying true to classic Japanese Mahjong rules, it requires a minimum of 1 han (fan) to declare a win, featuring over 50 yaku (winning patterns) such as <i>Riichi</i> (declaring a ready hand while concealed), <i>Pinfu</i> (a simple hand with no honor tiles), and <i>Chinisu</i> (all tiles of one suit). <i>Riichi</i> must be declared in a closed hand (no melds), adding challenge and excitement; <i>Pinfu</i> requires a hand of sequences and a pair with no honor tiles; <i>Chinisu</i> focuses on a single suit, offering diverse strategies for winning.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/9cb33b139132d89d06f37cebb9c1e26c.avif?t=1762921433\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras_big/9cb33b139132d89d06f37cebb9c1e26c.avif?t=1762921433 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the game includes an automatic scoring system that accurately calculates points based on han and fu (value units), simulating real-world matches. Enjoy the strategic depth and fun of Japanese Mahjong anytime, anywhere\u2014no internet needed\u2014perfect for solo play.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/c310e9ed92f044fdd5485efd4c8f7771.avif?t=1762921433\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras_big/c310e9ed92f044fdd5485efd4c8f7771.avif?t=1762921433 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are still three cheating skills that will make your dream of becoming a mahjong master come true~<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras/0a9aeda30c8bee93792056a3e697c6d5.avif?t=1762921433\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762280/extras_big/0a9aeda30c8bee93792056a3e697c6d5.avif?t=1762921433 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Xiaoyan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762280/abf8528f4610db9a266efe08f487828363340c31.jpg"},{"name":"Lili","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762280/a448591b5e04184fdc63056b6298084a16543915.jpg"},{"name":"Chen Jing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762280/350a69f0a5cf4d0ebc6191b6fc626b625f1aee83.jpg"},{"name":"Li Fang","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762280/4f65b621f56874ccf24bbf53ee07ac17f8626f41.jpg"},{"name":"Weina","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762280/2566b6323937946bb54fa53a64783d3d0827a2d5.jpg"},{"name":"Xiaojuan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762280/cbbbc4322da234eb463bca5aa1fb093d77f